# Punch a weapon-immune creature bare-handed, first without Ki Strike and then
# with it.
#
# The subject is a lemure (lib/mon4.irh:1205-1213), a CR 1 devil carrying
# ABILITY(CA_WEAPON_IMMUNITY,1). It is the cheapest true subject in the module:
# the immunity level is 1, so a Monk 4's Ki Strike +1 is exactly enough to beat
# it and a Monk 1's nothing is exactly not enough.
#
# The oracle is the message src/Fight.cpp:8510 prints when e.isWImmune is set:
# "Your weapon fails to penetrate." Nothing else in the game prints that line.
#
# The chargen prefix is tools/keys/monk-brawl-speed.keys, letter for letter,
# because that path is already proven at seed 1. The monk must fight with empty
# hands, so the starting long sword is stowed before anything is summoned.
#
# Menu letters move when a list changes; run this with the seed its caller
# supplies and no other.

a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Your options will place the game in Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
h       # Race:     [h] Lizardfolk
a       # Subrace:  [a] Lizardfolk (Standard)
e       # Class:    [e] Monk
a       # Attributes: the first of the five offered sets
c       # Alignment: [c] Neutral
a       # First feat
a       # Second feat

RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y

y       # Do you wish to worship <god>? -- yes

RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y

# In the dungeon now.
ESC ENTER SPACE

# Empty both hands. Chargen hands this character a long sword +3, and a held
# weapon would answer the question with its own plus instead of with Ki Strike.
i
b s
ESC

w       # wizard mode
y       # "Enter wizard mode?" -- yes
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN DOWN
SPACE   # Free Advancement: NO -> YES
ESC

# --- FIRST HALF: Monk 1, no Ki Strike, punching a weapon-immune devil -------
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Devils"
@choose "lemure"
RIGHT   # the location cursor starts on the player; one step east
ENTER
@dump:summoned-lvl1

RIGHT   # walk into it, which is to attack it
@dump:punch-lvl1
SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE

# --- LEVEL TO 4, WHICH IS WHERE KI STRIKE ARRIVES ---------------------------
# The character sheet is a menu, so no game time passes and the lemure is still
# standing to the east when this is done.
d
G
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" c
@while "You feel hardier" ESC
G
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" c
@while "You feel hardier" ESC
G
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" c
@while "You feel hardier" ESC
@until "Monk 4" ESC
@expect "Monk 4"
ESC     # back to the map

# --- SECOND HALF: Monk 4, Ki Strike +1, same fist, same devil ---------------
SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE
RIGHT
@dump:punch-lvl4
@quit
